          "why": "An acute angle is greater than 0° but less than 90°.",
          "sol": "Step 1: 24° is less than 90°.\nStep 2: An angle between 0° and 90° is acute.",
          "hint": "Compare it with 90°.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "geometry",
          "topic": "Classifying Angles",
          "conceptId": "math_geometry_classifying_angles",
          "skillId": "math_geometry",
          "subskillId": "math_geometry_q1"
