          "why": "Equal angles share the complete turn equally.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Total angle = 360°\nStep 2: Each angle = 360° / 5\nStep 3: Each angle = 72°.",
          "hint": "Divide 360° equally among five angles.",
          "subject": "math",
