          "why": "The area of a circle is found by multiplying π by the square of its radius.",
          "sol": "Step 1: A = πr².\nStep 2: A = 3.142 × 6².\nStep 3: 6² = 36.\nStep 4: A = 3.142 × 36.\nStep 5: A = 113.112 cm².",
