          "why": "The total perimeter is shared equally among the four sides.",
          "sol": "Step 1: P = 4s.\nStep 2: 52 = 4s.\nStep 3: s = 52 ÷ 4 = 13 m.",
          "hint": "Divide the perimeter by 4.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "geometry",
          "topic": "Perimeter of a Square",
          "conceptId": "math_geometry_perimeter_of_a_square",
