          "why": "When the area and perpendicular height are known, divide the area by the height to find the base.",
          "sol": "Step 1: A = b × h.\nStep 2: 120 = b × 8.\nStep 3: b = 120 ÷ 8.\nStep 4: b = 15 cm.",
