          "why": "The equality gives the boundary line.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Start with 2x + 3y ≥ 12.\nStep 2: Replace ≥ with =.\nStep 3: Write 2x + 3y = 12.",
          "hint": "Replace ≥ with =.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "linear_programming",
          "topic": "Converting an Inequality to Its Boundary Equation",
          "conceptId": "math_linear_programming_converting_an_inequality_to_its_boundary_equation",
