          "why": "The point (8, 4) lies on both boundary lines.",
          "sol": "Step 1: 2x = 16\nStep 2: x = 8\nStep 3: 8 + y = 12\nStep 4: y = 4",
          "hint": "Add the equations.",
          "subject": "math",
