          "why": "C gives the largest objective value.",
          "sol": "Step 1: A: 4(3) + 2 = 14.\nStep 2: B: 4(1) + 8 = 12.\nStep 3: C: 4(5) + 1 = 21.\nStep 4: 21 is greatest.",
          "hint": "Evaluate P at each point.",
          "subject": "math",
