          "why": "A common denominator is required before adding fractions.",
          "sol": "Step 1: LCM of 2 and 4 = 4.\nStep 2: 1/2 = 2/4.\nStep 3: 2/4 + 1/4 = 3/4.",
          "hint": "Change 1/2 into quarters.",
