          "why": "Rearranging A = 1/2bh gives h = 2A ÷ b.",
          "sol": "Step 1: h = 2A ÷ b.\nStep 2: h = (2 × 40) ÷ 10.\nStep 3: h = 80 ÷ 10.\nStep 4: h = 8.",
          "hint": "h = 2A ÷ b.",
          "subject": "math",
