          "why": "Three outcomes satisfy the condition.",
          "sol": "Step 1: The favourable outcomes are 4, 5 and 6.\nStep 2: There are 3 favourable outcomes.\nStep 3: There are 6 total outcomes.\nStep 4: P(>3) = 3/6 = 1/2.",
          "hint": "Which numbers are greater than 3?",
          "subject": "math",
