          "why": "The favourable frequency is 12 and the total frequency is 25.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Total = 12 + 8 + 5 = 25.\nStep 2: Football has 12 students.\nStep 3: P(football) = 12/25.",
          "hint": "Add all students first.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "probability",
