          "why": "The first toss does not affect the second toss.",
          "sol": "Step 1: The first result does not change the coin.\nStep 2: The second toss still has the same probabilities.\nStep 3: Therefore the tosses are independent.",
          "hint": "Does the first toss change the second toss?",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "probability",
