          "why": "Without replacement changes the sample for the next selection.",
          "sol": "Step 1: The first card is removed.\nStep 2: The number of available cards decreases.\nStep 3: Therefore the second selection is affected.",
          "hint": "Does the number of cards remain the same?",
          "subject": "math",
