          "sol": "Step 1: det(A) = 3 × 4 - 2 × 1 = 10.\nStep 2: Swap 3 and 4.\nStep 3: Change 2 to -2 and 1 to -1.\nStep 4: Multiply the resulting matrix by 1/10.\nStep 5: A⁻¹ = [2/5 -1/5; -1/10 3/10].",
          "hint": "First calculate the determinant.",
