          "why": "The midpoint must be halfway between A and B in both the horizontal and vertical directions.",
          "sol": "Step 1: 8 = (2 + x)/2, so 16 = 2 + x, giving x = 14.\nStep 2: 3 = (-5 + y)/2, so 6 = -5 + y, giving y = 11.\nStep 3: Therefore B = (14, 11).",
