          "why": "Each component of the resultant is the sum of the corresponding components of all the vectors.",
          "sol": "Step 1: x = 4 - 3 + 6 = 7\nStep 2: y = -2 + 5 + 1 = 4\nStep 3: Resultant = (7,4)",
